## Every lab HTML pattern

1. Business problem (`callout bad`)
2. Solution (`callout ok`)
3. BEFORE / AFTER (`.ba-grid` + photo or `.ba-diagram`)
4. Comic strips (`.comic-strip`) — Kai asks, Dev explains why
5. See-it cards (`.see-grid` / `.see-card`)
6. Teach-first + ≤12-line SQL chunks
7. `#interview-drill` / `.drill-wrap` with ≥4 hard exam Q&As
8. Priya wrap-up (`.soundbite`)

Cover full COF-C03 blueprint — see `docs/EXAM_BLUEPRINT.md`. Do not skip Cortex, Iceberg, Dynamic Tables, Trust Center, Clean Rooms, Snowpipe Streaming.

